{
  "_comment": "The film's score, built to the grid in beats.json. 'takes' are generated recordings (instrumental, 128 BPM, one key), saved as video/audio/takes/<id>.wav. 'cues' cut whole bars out of those takes onto film bars; 'fx' are synthesized on exact beats. 'clips' are finished audio files dropped in at a beat (the score ducks under them by a 'duck' colour). Bars and beats are 1-based film positions. 'seed' is the candidate kept. Build with: python video/tools/score.py",
